Need maybe create a leaf/needle card material not receiving fog? It's standard. Good.

Now update sky/lighting/fog. Let's design sky shader better. Current cloud dark issue. Change uniforms:
- uTop 0x4a7c99 (blue)
- uHorizon 0xeed6a9
- uSunColor 0xffd9a0
- uCloud maybe.
Fragment:
```
float h = clamp(dir.y,0,1);
vec3 col = mix(uHorizon, uTop, pow(h,0.42));
// horizon haze
float sd = max(dot(dir,uSun),0);
col += uSunColor*(pow(sd,900)*2.2 + pow(sd,8)*0.16);
// clouds
vec2 sp = dir.xz/(dir.y+0.16);
n = cloudNoise...
cloud = smoothstep(.55,.8,n) * smoothstep(.02,.25,dir.y)
cloudCol = mix(vec3(.64,.66,.64), vec3(1.0,.86,.66), pow(sd,2.))
col = mix(col, cloudCol, cloud*0.42)
```
